
<html>
<head>
  <style>
@font-face {
    font-family: 'Hippie';
    src: url('https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/Project-Noonnu/2610081905@hippie/hippie/hippie_히피체.woff2') format('woff2');
    font-weight: 400;
    font-display: swap;
}
@font-face {
    font-family: 'IsYun';
    src: url('https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/projectnoonnu/noonfonts_2202-2@1.0/LeeSeoyun.woff') format('woff');
    font-weight: normal;
    font-display: swap;
}
h1 {
font-family: "Hippie", sans-serif;
  color: #10564D;
  text-align: center;
  font-size:75px;
}
#start-scene {
  background-color: #D5FAEA;

  width: 100%;
  min-height: 100vh;
  box-sizing: border-box;

  display:flex;
  flex-direction:column;
  align-items:center;
  justify-content: center;
}
 #password-scene {
      display: none;
      background-color: #D5FAEA;
      width: 100%;
      min-height: 100vh;
      box-sizing: border-box;

      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-family: "Hippie", sans-serif;
    }

    #password-scene h2 {
      color: #10564D;
      font-size: 32px;
    }

    #password-scene input {
      font-family: "IsYun", sans-serif;
      font-size: 18px;
      padding: 10px;
    }

    #password-success {
      font-family: "Hippie", sans-serif;
      font-size: 60px;
      color: #10564D;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .hint.error {
      color: red;
      opacity: 1;
    }

    /*소신 발언 하자면, 어떤 이유로든 저희 학교에 오는 게 아니라면 딱히 쓸모없는 프로그램입니다...*/
    .hint {
      font-family: "IsYun", sans-serif;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #55736C;
      opacity: 0.5;
      text-align: center;
}
body {
  margin: 0;
}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <section id="start-scene">
      <h1>식물모아홍익랜듀얼레이드</h1>
 <button onclick="showPasswordScene()">
  <img src="시작하기.jpg" alt="시작하기">
</button>
  </section>
  
  <section id="password-scene">
    <h2>비밀번호를 입력하세요.</h2>

     <div id="password-form">
    <input id="password-input" type="password" placeholder="hongik2026">
       소신 발언 하자면, 어떤 이유로든 저희 학교에 오는 게 아니라면 딱히 쓸모없는 프로그램입니다...
       <p id="password-hint" class="hint">
      
    </p>

    <div class="button-row">
      <button onclick="checkPassword()">
        <img src="확인.png" alt="확인">
      </button>

      <button onclick="goBackToStart()">
        <img src="뒤로가기.png" alt="뒤로가기">
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h1 id="password-success" style="display:none;">
    확인!
  </h1>
</section>
</body>
</html>
